      *****************************************************************
      * RETCODES - Shared return codes (owned by App1)
      *****************************************************************
       01  RETURN-CODES.
           05  RC-OK                   PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
           05  RC-WARNING              PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 4.
           05  RC-INVALID              PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 8.
           05  RC-ERROR                PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 12.
